4-77b4c8a93b6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb0e6ff317c6677f1694b8fb6fc72fc8 3x"}, "body": "Thank you very much for your wonderful illustrations last time.\nI would like to request another illustration from you.\nMay I ask for an illustration with a realistic head after a long time?\nI would like to ask you to illustrate two girls.\n\nOne girl, rather large for a woman. She has very large, beautiful gray wings on her back, but she has both confidence and anxiety about flying, and has not yet been able to fly or has never flown.\nAnother girl, a rather small girl. The girl has small, white wings on her back that would be very difficult to fly. But she is not pessimistic about her inability to fly, and believes in doing only what she can now. She is cheerful and doesn't care that she can't fly with her wings.\nI would like an illustration of the little winged girl holding the hand of the big winged girl who was sitting on the gym and crying because she was scared, and trying to make her stand up, or trying to force her up from her sitting position and start running.\n\nIf you are too busy, you may refuse my request.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wancohome/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2136158, "client_id": 2154685, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1191317e/uploads/origins/e1d505c6-45b0-45b5-ae61-76e3e9dabf88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec4022e7ebb7a499ad65188f06aaee68", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1191317e/uploads/origins/e1d505c6-45b0-45b5-ae61-76e3e9dabf88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec4022e7ebb7a499ad65188f06aaee68, https://si.imgix.net/1191317e/uploads/origins/e1d505c6-45b0-45b5-ae61-76e3e9dabf88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Cco