ctive).\nI would like to request an illustration of a black doggy (detective) sitting on a chair drinking tea and happily eating Christmas cake in an elegant English-style room with a fireplace.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wancohome/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2136158, "client_id": 2154685, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9da1ac2a/uploads/origins/b403805c-d383-42d6-9d37-62176115ea43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6743e8caa732755b56cff5025ca8a8f3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9da1ac2a/uploads/origins/b403805c-d383-42d6-9d37-62176115ea43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6743e8caa732755b56cff5025ca8a8f3, https://si.imgix.net/9da1ac2a/uploads/origins/b403805c-d383-42d6-9d37-62176115ea43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98fe94a1dc2cf9308184d59390d46edd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9da1ac2a/uploads/origins/b403805c-d383-42d6-9d37-62176115ea43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70dddaaa635ddb1f5e61a039899a16ad 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9da1ac2a/uploads/origins/b403805c-d383-42d6-9d37-62176115ea43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e21b18f6379544dad1efa0b745b61c42", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9da1ac2a/uploads/origins/b403805c-d383-42d6-9d37-62176115ea43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e21b18f6379544dad1efa0b745b61c42, https://si.imgix.net/9da1ac2a/uploads/origins/b403805c-d383-42d6-9d37-62176115ea43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c2ddf7dec710df2b9fc457aaa3014391 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9da1ac2a/uploads/origins/b403805c-d383-42d6-9d37-62176115ea43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c3d1565bb679794eb12522949f17c1f 3x"}, "body": "I want to see dogs enjoying a white Christmas.\n\nIt doesn't matter how long it takes.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wancohome/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2136158, "client_id": 132397, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e2228298/uploads/origins/0390198a-d29f-4b1f-aac7-fb83387348ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac87a6957e692774b9a1e57c86c12c35", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e2228298/uploads/origins/0390198a-d29f-4b1f-aac7-fb83387348ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac87a6957e692774b9a1e57c86c12c35, https://si.imgix.net/e2228298/uploads/origins/0390198a-d29f-4b1f-aac7-fb83387348ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eed705cf9b0c3ea4337f0d56d2e11498 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e2228298/uploads/origins/0390198a-d29f-4b1f-aac7-fb83387348ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e73cc6a985894a337b30b4ca1b4a2de 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e2228298/uploads/origins/0390198a-d29f-4b1f-aac7-fb83387348ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=50b44f47288ea252483cf596f64a118e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e2228298/uploads/origins/0390198a-d29f-4b1f-aac7-fb83387348ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=50b44f47288ea252483cf596f64a118e, https://si.imgix.net/e2228298/uploads/origins/0390198a-d29f-4b1f-aac7-fb83387348ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e2df40c669dd82c21ed7ce249b5a621 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e2228298/uploads/origins/0390198a-d29f-4b1f-aac7-fb83387348ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7ddf4196eed79488b230511c74c0f279 3x"}, "body": "Good evening, Dr. Wanko.\nThank you for the wonderful illustration you drew last time. I love the warmth of your illustrations and look at them over and over again. I would like to make another request this time.\nThe request is for two spirit girls. The request was based on the apocalyptic idea of the Got Theory, which is highly questionable as a theory, and the image of the Yokohama Shopping Spree, which I myself like, but don't worry about this one too much.\n\nThere are two girls in the ruins.\nOne is a girl as red as fire, with flaming hair, a flame spirit in a dress, marrow eyebrows, three white eyes, double teeth and a face that is triumphant and powerful, as if it were gushing with life.\nOne is a water spirit girl in a suit of watery blue, straight-haired hair, somewhat fragile and disappearing, in an outdoor, unoccupied ruin.\nThe girl of fire is playing a violin, and the girl of water is playing a piano with her feet slightly submerged in the ruins.\nThey are playing their instruments very happily, paying no attention to the collapse of their surroundings.\nThey look as if they are telling us that the last sunset of the world, which will soon come to an end, was a very happy and warm time, and they are playing the instrument happily without paying any attention to the formality of playing the instrument.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wancohome/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2136158, "client_id": 132397, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b636b881/uploads/origins/c6315cba-d5e9-4a9d-adf7-d05575207de2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c134af967a5e1ac4a06fc31622aa9e79", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b636b881/uploads/origins/c6315cba-d5e9-4a9d-adf7-d05575207de2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c134af967a5e1ac4a06fc31622aa9e79, https://si.imgix.net/b636b881/uploads/origins/c6315cba-d5e9-4a9d-adf7-d05575207de2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bc32baa2e1bc1b6db1664dc7b3e56d9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b636b881/uploads/origins/c6315cba-d5e9-4a9d-adf7-d05575207de2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8ea2255494137f438a24cd2d1145c71 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b636b881/uploads/origins/c6315cba-d5e9-4a9d-adf7-d05575207de2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cefd14c6a6b2c4c45522bb4378ba6d72", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b636b881/uploads/origins/c6315cba-d5e9-4a9d-adf7-d05575207de2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cefd14c6a6b2c4c45522bb4378ba6d72, https://si.imgix.net/b636b881/uploads/origins/c6315cba-d5e9-4a9d-adf7-d05575207de2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dd0330e4d9c0eaf388cfc60e2feeab3a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b636b881/uploads/origins/c6315cba-d5e9-4a9d-adf7-d05575207de2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=97a62ab91c8682e6ab56a1ab5bb016e2 3x"}, "body": "I always enjoy looking at your wonderful illustrations and thumbnails.\nWhat I would like to request this time is the scenery of SS I used to write on my personal site.\n\nThe sky is the world of the sea.\nThe earth is normal, but the sea floats in the sky.\nFish and whales are swimming in it. The sea, which floats in the sky like a film covering the stars, does not fall out of the atmosphere, but covers the sky. The sun's rays can be seen slightly beyond the sea.\nThere are two people in a grassy field.\nOne is a boy in white with slightly fox-eared hair. The boy is looking through a telescope into the empty sea.\nOne is a girl with cat ears wearing a raincoat. The girl is spreading out a picnic blanket and spreading out her lunch.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wancohome/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2136158, "client_id": 2167400, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e3a8a4d0/uploads/origins/5daaf4fe-15c1-4fd2-9bba-8de209bf432b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aec13524b30f009c060f9be14a23746e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e3a8a4d0/uploads/origins/5daaf4fe-15c1-4fd2-9bba-8de209bf432b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aec13524b30f009c060f9be14a23746e, https://si.imgix.net/e3a8a4d0/uploads/origins/5daaf4fe-15c1-4fd2-9bba-8de209bf432b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=755970f954f373bf332ebed15fca6482 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e3a8a4d0/uploads/origins/5daaf4fe-15c1-4fd2-9bba-8de209bf432b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c1d5da94a51d4462558ddaf17f3856e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e3a8a4d0/uploads/origins/5daaf4fe-15c1-4fd2-9bba-8de209bf432b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=de4da12c991b753d3ca28202b59ef007", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e3a8a4d0/uploads/origins/5daaf4fe-15c1-4fd2-9bba-8de209bf432b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=2